* AD5453 behavioural model (hand-written, not an Analog Devices model).
* R-2R ladder seen from VREF as 9k, IOUT1 = VREF x code / 16384 / 9k, 9k feedback resistor.
* Digital pins are not modelled; set the code with the CODE parameter.
.subckt AD5453 iout gnd vref rfb params: code=16383
Rladder vref gnd 9k
Biout gnd iout I=V(vref,gnd)*{code}/16384/9k
Rfb iout rfb 9k
.ends AD5453
